          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "atlasAdmin or root role for application users: Applications should never have admin roles; use read/readWrite scoped to their databases",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-security-architecture/#common-security-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Storing MongoDB credentials in application code or git: Use secrets manager or environment variables",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-security-architecture/#common-security-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Not enabling MFA: Single-factor Atlas UI access is a security gap for admin accounts",
