          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "X.509 certificates without a CA: Self-signed certs without a CA make certificate rotation extremely painful",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/mongodb-security-architecture/#common-security-anti-patterns",
